# The fitted action half: 122 million numbers a seed, which is about half a
# gigabyte each. train.py makes it again from solution 6's demonstrations, so
# nothing is lost by leaving it out. What the fitting did (training.json) and
# how its numbers were scaled (stats.json) are small and stay in, because
# those are what a reader needs.
fitted*/head.pt
videos/
__pycache__/

# A short run writes a scratch scorecard beside the real one, and the
# scorecard now writes a per-table sibling beside whatever it saves.
partial.json
partial-tables.json
asking-partial.json
